BEGIN KKVMPNAV

EXTEND_BOTTOM BODHIAMB 5
IF ~Global("KKNavBodhiAbduction","GLOBAL",0)
      Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2) 
      InParty("KKNavar")~ THEN DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavBodhiAbduction","GLOBAL",1)~ + KKNBA
END

APPEND BODHIAMB
IF ~~ THEN KKNBA
SAY ~You follow in the hopes of retrieving something dear to you. I say that the longer you keep this up, the more you will lose.~ 
IF ~OR(2)
      !InPartyAllowDead("KKNavar")
      Dead("KKNavar")~ THEN GOTO 6
IF ~InPartyAllowDead("KKNavar")
      !Dead("KKNavar")~ THEN GOTO KKNBAa
END

END

CHAIN
IF ~~ THEN BODHIAMB KKNBAa
~Consider young Navarra here.  Fearsome little warrior but misdirected. I think she'd be of more use fighting on my side.~
== ~KKNavJ~ IF ~InMyArea("KKNavar") !StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ THEN ~I will never do your bidding, foul creature!~
== BODHIAMB ~I don't think you understand, you barbaric fool, you have no choice! Pay attention <CHARNAME>.  Follow me further and you will lose more than you can imagine!  Starting now!~
END
  IF ~~ THEN DO ~ClearAllActions()
StartCutSceneMode()
StartCutScene("KKNCUT01")
~ UNSOLVED_JOURNAL ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi appeared in an ambush shortly before I reached her haven, warning me that she was aware of my pursuit and stealing from me the one person that is dearest to my heart: Navarra. Before she vanished and unleashed more of her undead creations upon me, Bodhi warned me that if I continue I will lose even more than I thought possible. I cannot give up on the Rhynn Lanthorn... but now the life and immortal soul of the one I love is at stake, as well!~ EXIT

EXTEND_BOTTOM C6BODHI 21
IF ~Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN GOTO 23
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM C6BODHI 23
IF ~Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN REPLY ~You have taken too much already!  You will return both Imoen's soul and Navarra!~ + KKNBAb
IF ~Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN REPLY ~And you have delivered on that promise. Return Navarra and perhaps I will be merciful.~ + KKNBAb
IF ~Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN REPLY ~I would have hunted you for your theft of Navarra alone. she is very important to me.~ + KKNBAb
IF ~Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN REPLY ~You place too much confidence in sentiment. The theft of Navarra will not save you.~ + KKNBAc
END

APPEND C6BODHI 

IF ~~ THEN KKNBAb
  SAY ~She is lost to you, <CHARNAME>.  Navarra was quite receptive to my discipline.  I doubt your fumbling could have inspired the loyalty I have taken with a bite and a gaze.~
IF ~~ THEN UNSOLVED_JOURNAL ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi has turned Navarra into a vampire!  Or... or very nearly. The process may not have been completed in the short time Bodhi has had her. Hopefully something can be done or I will have lost her. Perhaps the elven war sage might know some way of restoration... or Elhan... ~ EXTERN KKVMPNAV KKNBAd
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNBAc
SAY ~An interesting ploy, though I am sure his fate will still serve as an example, whether you wish her back or not.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKNBAb
END

END //APPEND C6BODHI

CHAIN KKVMPNAV KKNBAd
~I am here to do your bidding mistress.~
== C6BODHI ~Don't you see, <CHARNAME>? She is not even fully turned and she has betrayed you.  Prepare to die at your lover's hand!~
END C6BODHI 28

EXTEND_BOTTOM C6ELHAN2 70
+ ~PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~Elhan!  I've the half vampire body of Navarra here because of you!  You'll tell me now!~ GOTO 76
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM DOGHMA 0 #5
+ ~Global("RevealUmar","GLOBAL",1)
PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~A friend is afflicted by vampirism.  An old book suggested that followers of Oghma might know something about that.~ GOTO 10
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM DOGHMA 3 7 9 #4
+ ~Global("RevealUmar","GLOBAL",1)
PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~A friend is afflicted by vampirism.  An old book suggested that followers of Oghma might know something about that.~ GOTO 10
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM IMNBOOK1 0
+ ~Global("RevealUmar","GLOBAL",1)
PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~I'm looking for information about a tome that details the curing of Vampirism.~ GOTO 4
END

ADD_STATE_TRIGGER OGHMONK1 0 ~!PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ 1 2 3

APPEND OGHMONK1

IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("RevealUmar","GLOBAL",1)
PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ THEN BEGIN OghmaMonk#1.1
SAY ~Have you come seeking wisdom from the Binder of What is Known? The Wise God stands ready.~
++ ~No, thank you, I have no need of help at the moment.~ GOTO 5
++ ~A friend is afflicted by vampirism.  An old book suggested that followers of Oghma might know something about that.~ GOTO 6
END

END

EXTEND_BOTTOM SUDEMIN 2
+ ~PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~I lost a loved one in a battle with his sister, Bodhi.  I seek a means of curing her.~ GOTO 3
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM WARSAGE 0
+ ~!Dead("c6bodhi")
Global("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~A loved one was taken by a vampire. What can I expect when I find them?~ GOTO 6
+ ~PartyHasItem("KKNavBDY")~ + ~Someone I care about has fallen to a vampire. Is there any way to save them?~ GOTO 5
END

APPEND ~KKNavP~

IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKNavarVampireTalk","GLOBAL",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2
SAY ~What..is happening?~
= ~(Navarra's eyes regain focus and she looks at you, clearly shaken.)~
= ~I...was dead, no much worse than dead. Sshe turned me into one of them, a disgusting vampire and I tried to kill you! I tried to fight sher <CHARNAME> and I'm ashamed of myself because I couldn't.~
= ~And inspite of all that, you saved me.~
++ ~It's all right, Navarra. It's over now.~ DO ~EraseJournalEntry(32084)
EraseJournalEntry(32085)
EraseJournalEntry(16351)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi appeared in an ambush shortly before I reached her haven, warning me that she was aware of my pursuit and stealing from me the one person that is dearest to my heart: Navarra. Before she vanished and unleashed more of her undead creations upon me, Bodhi warned me that if I continue I will lose even more than I thought possible. I cannot give up on the Rhynn Lanthorn... but now the life and immortal soul of the one I love is at stake, as well!%)
EraseJournalEntry(15710)
EraseJournalEntry(6589)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi has turned Navarra into a vampire!  Or... or very nearly. The process may not have been completed in the short time Bodhi has had her. Hopefully something can be done or I will have lost her. Perhaps the elven war sage might know some way of restoration... or Elhan...%)
SetGlobal("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",5) SetGlobal("KKNavarVampireTalk","GLOBAL",2)~ SOLVED_JOURNAL ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

While I had feared for some time that Bodhi's final revenge on me would be to take away Navarra forever, it seems that the information in the lorebook was right...  Amaunator's idol has restored Navarra not only to life, but has removed the vampiric curse from her, as well.~ + KKNBA2a
++ ~Of course I did! I couldn't....wouldn't lose you! I was so worried....so afraid but I had to save you.~ DO ~EraseJournalEntry(32084)
EraseJournalEntry(32085)
EraseJournalEntry(16351)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi appeared in an ambush shortly before I reached her haven, warning me that she was aware of my pursuit and stealing from me the one person that is dearest to my heart: Navarra. Before she vanished and unleashed more of her undead creations upon me, Bodhi warned me that if I continue I will lose even more than I thought possible. I cannot give up on the Rhynn Lanthorn... but now the life and immortal soul of the one I love is at stake, as well!%)
EraseJournalEntry(15710)
EraseJournalEntry(6589)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi has turned Navarra into a vampire!  Or... or very nearly. The process may not have been completed in the short time Bodhi has had her. Hopefully something can be done or I will have lost her. Perhaps the elven war sage might know some way of restoration... or Elhan...%)
SetGlobal("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",5)~ SOLVED_JOURNAL ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

While I had feared for some time that Bodhi's final revenge on me would be to take away Navarra forever, it seems that the information in the lorebook was right...  Amaunator's idol has restored Navarra not only to life, but has removed the vampiric curse from her, as well.~ + KKNBA2d
++ ~Well, it's over now and your alive. I got she Lanthorn and that's what matters most.~ DO ~EraseJournalEntry(32084)
EraseJournalEntry(32085)
EraseJournalEntry(16351)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi appeared in an ambush shortly before I reached her haven, warning me that she was aware of my pursuit and stealing from me the one person that is dearest to my heart: Navarra. Before she vanished and unleashed more of her undead creations upon me, Bodhi warned me that if I continue I will lose even more than I thought possible. I cannot give up on the Rhynn Lanthorn... but now the life and immortal soul of the one I love is at stake, as well!%)
EraseJournalEntry(15710)
EraseJournalEntry(6589)
EraseJournalEntry(%The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi has turned Navarra into a vampire!  Or... or very nearly. The process may not have been completed in the short time Bodhi has had her. Hopefully something can be done or I will have lost her. Perhaps the elven war sage might know some way of restoration... or Elhan...%)
SetGlobal("KKNavarVampire","GLOBAL",5)~
SOLVED_JOURNAL ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

While I had feared for some time that Bodhi's final revenge on me would be to take away Navarra forever, it seems that the information in the lorebook was right...  Amaunator's idol has restored Navarra not only to life, but has removed the vampiric curse from her, as well.~ + KKNBA2e
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2a
SAY ~It may be over, but it doesn't excuse the fact that I tried...wanted to hurt you.~
= ~I saw you and all I could think about was blood. I am so sorry my love.~
++ ~There's no need to apologize, it wasn't your fault. I'm just glad you're alright.~ + KKNBA2b
++ ~I'm sorry, but I don't have room for you in the party right now.~ + KKNBA2c
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2b
SAY ~Maybe it wasn't, but it doesn't lessen the guilt. I'm just grateful that I didn't hurt you, my love.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~JoinParty()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2c
SAY ~You....you don't have *room* for me? After everything we've been through you now choose to throw that all away? So be it!~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) SetGlobal("NavarraJoined","LOCALS",0) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2d
SAY ~I was just as afraid, my love. If anything ever happened to you because of me...~
= ~I can't bear the thought. Let's just get out of here, please.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~JoinParty()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2e
SAY ~What are you saying? After all we've been through, you were more concerned about that than me?~
++ ~Of course not! If I didn't love you, I wouldn't have saved you. But the Lanthorn is important, Irenicus must be stopped.~ + KKNBA2f
++ ~Of course, the Lanthorn is what's most important. Irenicus must be stopped and my soul returned.~ + KKNBA2g
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2f
SAY ~I love you too. And I agree completely, Irenicus will be stopped. I will slit his throat personally if I get the chance.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~JoinParty()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN KKNBA2g
SAY ~I can't believe what I'm hearing, after all we've been through. Fine, if that's the way you want it! Goodbye, <CHARNAME>.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) SetGlobal("NavarraJoined","LOCALS",0) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

END